<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gentyre sells unit, issues profit warning.</title>
<headline>Gentyre sells unit, issues profit warning.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gentyre Industries Ltd said on Monday it had concluded a transaction for the disposal of non-operating investment which would have a positive effect on its earnings for the current year.</p>
<p>It said full details of the transaction and its financial effects would be published at a further date. It urged shareholders to exercise caution until that time.</p>
<p>Gentyre further warned that its operating results for the six months ended December 31, 1996 would be below those for the six months ended December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
